id: perfect-counter
name: Perfect Counter
talentCategory: counter
prerequisites: Fierce Counter, Tier of Power 2+
description: >
  Able to defend even without preparations, your ability to counterattack is peerless.
text: >
  Perfect Counter: Able to defend even without preparations, your ability to counterattack is peerless.
  –Prerequisites: Fierce Counter, Tier of Power 2+
  (1)-[Passive]: The 1/Round Keyword on the first effect of Wild Counter becomes 3/Round.
  (2)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: When you are targeted by an Attacking Maneuver, use the Parry option of the Defend Maneuver without spending a Counter Action.

---

[passive]
# (1) Wild Counter's Basic Attack three times a Round (chat.mjs offerWildCounter, wildCounterUsed).
allow counter.perfectWild;
# (2) The Parry chosen in Respond: asked, once a Round - no Counter Action spent for it (chat.mjs, where a Defend is paid).
allow counter.perfectParry;
